                  },
                  "linkStyle": {
                    "inherit": true,
                    "linkColor": "#514293",
                    "linkHoverColor": "#514293",
                    "linkUnderline": true,
                    "linkHoverUnderline": true
                  },
                  "text": "Hey friend,<br><br>Thanks for joining Marisol, a newsletter about life when you’re no longer young but definitely not old. New editions arrive every Tuesday and Friday morning. Our favourite thing is telling the stories of other women in this stage of life, but you’ll also get:<br><br>•&nbsp; Shopping guides for coats, jeans, boots and more<br>•&nbsp; Recommendations for your week, from shows to podcasts to recipes<br>•&nbsp; Stories and essays by and for women over 35<br>•&nbsp; And more!<br><br>Now that you’re here, a few easy ways to stop us landing in spam (we work hard on these and don’t want you to miss out):<br><br><strong>On a phone?</strong> Move us to your main inbox from the menu at the top.<br><strong>On a computer?</strong> Drag this email into your main inbox.<br><br>Can’t wait until Friday? Follow us on <a href=\"https://example.com\" style=\"color:#E8A82A;\">social media</a> and read our <a href=\"https://example.com\" style=\"color:#E8A82A;\">archive</a>. See you Tuesday!<br><br>Team Marisol",
                  "fontSize": "15px",
                  "fontFamily": {
                    "label": "Helvetica",
                    "value": "helvetica,sans-serif"
                  },
                  "color": "#1A1A1A",
                  "textAlign": "left",
                  "lineHeight": "160%",
                  "containerPadding": "16px 24px 24px"
                }
              }
            ],
